<http://model.geneontology.org/657ba49f00001182> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                  <http://geneontology.org/lego/modelstate> "production" ;
                                                  <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2979-8613" ;
                                                  <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2025-04-14" ;
                                                  <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> """astrocytic Best1-mediated glutamate on
postsynaptic NMDARs upon PAR-1 activation (Human)""" ;
                                                  <http://purl.org/pav/providedBy> "https://www.uniprot.org" ;
                                                  rdfs:comment """Previous data already showed that PARs activate
phospholipase C (PLC), which converts membrane bound
phosphatidyl inositol (4,5)-bisphosphate into inositol
trisphosphate (InsP3) and diacylglycerol. InsP3 diffuses
into the cytoplasm and triggers release of Ca2 from the
endoplasmic reticulum by binding to InsP3 receptors
(Wang et al., 2002b).""" ;
                                                  <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/in_taxon> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_9606> .

